WEBVTT

00:11:28.579 --> 00:11:33.246
But when we push aside normal emotions
to embrace false positivity,

00:11:34.371 --> 00:11:39.371
we lose our capacity to develop skills
to deal with the world as it is.

00:11:40.371 --> 00:11:45.371
Not as we wish it to be. I've had hundreds
of people tell me what they

00:11:45.371 --> 00:11:48.662
don't want to feel. They say things like,

00:11:49.246 --> 00:11:52.204
I don't want to try because I don't
want to feel disappointed.

00:11:53.371 --> 00:11:56.871
Or I just want this feeling to go away.

00:11:59.579 --> 00:12:04.371
I understand I said to them, but
you have dead people's goals.